============================================================================================
WHAT THIS CANNOT SETTLE
============================================================================================
  Per-factor inertness is untouched: each inert factor carries 0.050 of the
  weight at d=6 and 0.025 at d=8, so every individual nuisance factor at d=8
  is half as influential and correspondingly easier to identify as inert.
  ONE CONFOUND OF THREE. This is not 'we isolated the mechanism'.
